00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:32.320
So this is really a story about how much of a&nbsp;
mess this country is in. You've got a 62 year&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:38.400
old who's unvaccinated by choice. That's part of&nbsp;
the weaponized disinformation about the vaccines.&nbsp;&nbsp;

